  "persona": "",
  "subject": "A white-gloved hotel doorman in Taipei counts one-two-three for every turn of the revolving door, and a woman in a green skirt who takes it twice every Thursday afternoon never says why.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien hard-bop jazz waltz in 3/4, relaxed swinging pulse. Piano trio with walking upright bass, brushed drums on the ride, tenor saxophone playing the head with the voice, muted trumpet fills in the bridge. Vintage Blue Note-style room sound with light spring reverb. Male vocal, warm easy baritone, conversational delivery, clearly sung melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 108 BPM, B-flat major. Wistful, graceful, gently amused mood. No electric guitar, no synth, no heavy distortion, no autotune, no rap.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n旋轉門一輾，我數一，二，三\n我佇飯店門口，穿白手套\n逐禮拜四下晡，三點十分\n彼个穿青色裙的小姐，行過來\n[Pre-Chorus]\n別人行一輾就入去\n伊行兩輾，轉出來閣轉入去\n[Chorus]\n一，二，三，伊閣轉一輾\n我共門扶好，毋敢開喙\n一，二，三，伊笑一下\n三拍的華爾滋，是門咧彈\n[Verse]\n我問伊：小姐，你欲揣啥人\n伊講：無，我共這扇門當舞伴\n我的手套，白甲袂皺\n我的跤，佇門外踏三拍\n[Pre-Chorus]\n一輾，我數三拍\n兩輾，我閣數三拍\n[Chorus]\n一，二，三，伊閣轉一輾\n玻璃反光，照著伊的裙\n一，二，三，我佇旁邊\n三拍的華爾滋，我嘛會曉\n[Verse]\n今仔日拜四，三點十分過矣\n我數一，二，三，空空\n到四點，門家己轉\n伊對後門入來，笑咧\n[Bridge]\n我共手套褪落來\n小姐，這擺我欲佮你轉一輾\n[Chorus]\n一，二，三，咱做伙轉一輾\n我無共門扶，我共你扶\n一，二，三，經理佇看\n三拍的華爾滋，毋驚人看\n[Outro]\n一，二，三，旋轉門\n轉出來，是下晡的日頭",
